; Portcullis + certify flags for the generated imt-gap R1CS book.
;
; This gadget is the decompose-once AssetRegistryGap export. Its
; *GADGET-IMT-GAP-constraints* literal is large enough that SBCL's file compiler
; can overflow a (SIGNED-BYTE 19) offset while building the .fasl. Certify it
; interpreted (compile-flg nil) -- the book is pure generated constraint data,
; so there is no proof work to compile and no runtime cost that matters for
; downstream composition proofs.

(ld "rtl/rel11/package.lsp" :dir :system)
(include-book "kestrel/crypto/r1cs/portcullis" :dir :system)

; cert-flags: ? nil
